---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import confPhoto from '../assets/conf-sud-photo.jpg';
---

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about__inner">
    <p class="about__lede reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 80ms">
      For the love of the  <em class="serif-italic">game.</em>
    </p>

    <p class="about__body reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 160ms">
      <strong>At the core of every good fighting game is a robust system,</strong> designed with
      rules to govern player interactions across a near-infinite space of player decisions tuned to
      produce fierce, dynamic competition. Around every game is a community, and around every community
      is a system of organizers, players, spectators, and more bringing everything to life.
    </p>

    <p class="about__body reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 200ms">
      I'm a software engineer with 7 years building backend systems for both startups and enterprise teams,
      and I'm developed tools to connect and develop communities for the Fighting Game Community (FGC).
      Currently building AI systems to organize how I think and work, from agentic research to work
      automation and new ways of working with AI.
    </p>

    <figure class="about__figure reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 220ms">
      <Image
        src={confPhoto}
        alt="Noah with the fighting game community he runs events for"
        class="about__photo"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <figcaption class="about__caption">With the community I build for.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <p class="about__body reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 240ms">
      As a community leader, I organize multiple online event series and support major offline events for
      my local Chicago scene and a small, global online community. I also publish
      <a href="https://endotlee.substack.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">In Your Corner</a>
      on Substack.
    </p>
    
    <p class="about__body reveal" style="--reveal-delay: 260ms">
      When I'm not working, you can find me playing fighting games or creating content to
      teach and grow my community. I love hearing about new ideas, so if you're building and want to work
      together, <a href="#contact">get in touch</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
    background: var(--color-paper);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .about__inner {
    max-width: 38rem;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .about__lede {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .about__lede .serif-italic {
    color: var(--color-rust);
    font-size: 0.95em;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .about__body {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .about__body strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about__body a {
    color: var(--color-rust);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rust);
    transition: color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .about__body a:hover {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  /* Editorial community photo: full-width within the prose column, sits between
     the engineering and personal paragraphs as the pivot from work to human. */
  .about__figure {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.625rem;
  }

  .about__photo {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  }

  .about__caption {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about { padding: 5rem 1.5rem; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .about { padding: 4rem 1.25rem; }
  }
</style>
